LOCUS       4634_V5LP_pH2rU3       13522 bp DNA     circular SYN 11-OCT-2024
DEFINITION  Landing pad lentivirus backbone expressing the Spike from 229E-CoV 
            strain 5/9/84, with the last 19 amino acids removed. The Spike was 
            codon-optimized by Twist and cloned into plasmid 4016 at the 5' MulI
            and 3' AscI sites. Please note: there is one point deletion in 
            position 3926. the plasmid was fully sequenced at Primodium by Sheri
            Harari on 02/02/24.
ACCESSION   <unknown
